   "keyVocab": [
    "Histogram: columns showing the frequency of numerical data in class intervals; bars touch",
    "Dot plot: one dot per data value above a number line",
    "Stem plot: each value split into a stem (leading digits) and a leaf (last digit), with a key",
    "Shape: symmetric, positively skewed or negatively skewed",
    "Outlier: a value that stands out from the rest of the data",
    "Log scale: an axis in powers of 10, for data spanning several orders of magnitude"
   ]
